  • <a href="https://www.amazon.com/s?k=microgreen+seeds+variety+pack&tag=tabletopharve-20" target="_blank" rel="nofollow sponsored">Microgreen seed variety pack</a> ($4. Start with broccoli, radish, and sunflower)<br>
